-23T23:59:59","text":"SECTION A: FOR MALAYSIAN WATERS [WITHIN 24 NAUTICAL MILES] 1) THUNDERSTORMS WARNING Thunderstorms, heavy rain and strong winds are expected over the waters of Perlis & Kedah \u2022 Penang \u2022 Perak \u2022 Selangor \u2022 N. Sembilan \u2022 Melaka \u2022 Johor \u2022 Pahang \u2022 Terengganu \u2022 Kelantan \u2022 Sarawak \u2022 Sabah until 6:00 PM; Thursday, 19 November 2026. This condition may cause strong winds up to 50 kmph and rough seas with wave height up to 3.5 metres and is dangerous to small boats. SECTION B: FOR SHIPPING 1) WARNING ON STRONG WINDS AND ROUGH SEAS (FIRST CATEGORY) Strong northeasterly winds of 40 - 50 kmph with wave height up to 3.5 metres are expected over the waters of Condore \u2022 Western part of Reef North \u2022 Southeastern Samui \u2022 Northern Tioman until Monday, 23 November 2026. This condition of strong winds and rough seas is dangerous to small crafts, recreational sea activities and water sports. 2) THUNDERSTORMS WARNING Thunderstorms, heavy rain and strong winds are expected over the waters of Samui \u2022 Tioman \u2022 Eastern part of Phuket \u2022 Straits Of Melaka \u2022 Sulawesi \u2022 Reef South \u2022 Southwestern Reef North \u2022 Sulu \u2022 Southeastern Condore \u2022 Labuan \u2022 Northeastern Bunguran until 6:00 PM; Thursday, 19 November 2026. This condition may cause strong winds up to 50 kmph and rough seas with wave height up to 3.5 metres and is dangerous to small boats.","areas":["Labuan","Sulu","Sulawesi","Reef North","Reef South","Condore","Sabah","Sarawak","Kelantan","Terengganu","Pahang","Johor","Selangor","Perak","Penang","Kedah","Perlis","Melaka","N. Sembilan","Samui","Tioman","Phuket","Straits Of Melaka"],"subsections":[{"text":"1) THUNDERSTORMS WARNING Thunderstorms, heavy rain and strong winds are expected over the waters of Perlis & Kedah \u2022 Penang \u2022 Perak \u2022 Selangor \u2022 N. Sembilan \u2022 Melaka \u2022 Johor \u2022 Pahang \u2022 Terengganu \u2022 Kelantan \u